<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: VW Czech unit Jan-April output up 26.3 pct.</title>
<headline>VW Czech unit Jan-April output up 26.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Skoda Automobiblova a.s., the Czech unit of Volkswagen AG, said on Thursday that its January-April output rose 26.3 percent, year-on-year, to a record 113,513 units.</p>
</text>
